<feed xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><title>BBC Chinese</title><subtitle type="html">BBC Chinese - BBC News , 中文 - 主頁</subtitle><id>https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:12:50Z</updated><author><name>rssync</name></author><link rel="self" href="rss.xml" type="application/atom+xml" /><link rel="alternate" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/trad" /><link rel="via" href="https://feeds.bbci.co.uk/zhongwen/trad/rss.xml" type="application/rss+xml" /><entry><title>台北選戰：蔣萬安的2028前哨戰，沈伯洋能否靠「洋流」突圍？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T00:11:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad--60e83cbe470a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck0j0wv57jw7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">原先不被看好的沈伯洋，自宣布參選後大力改變形象，近期聲勢高漲，給本享有執政優勢的蔣萬安帶來了挑戰。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國女囚死刑執行失敗：注射兩劑藥物仍存活，接下來將如何發展？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2z2dqv080o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:12:44Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T05:09:27Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2z2dqv080o/trad--a8e53fa7f3cf.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6x2z2dqv080o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">這名被定罪的殺人犯在兩次致命注射後仍然生還，目前在醫院病床上甦醒，並已開始說話。這是當地半年內第二宗死刑執行失敗事件，引發許多疑問。</summary></entry><entry><title>俄羅斯鼠疫實驗室人員死亡 美方稱「密切關注」</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx28nw0kn47o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T04:41:10Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx28nw0kn47o/trad--449ee26b8af5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqx28nw0kn47o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">鼠疫桿菌，又稱耶爾森氏鼠疫桿菌（Yersinia pestis）曾在 14 世紀導致歐洲一半人口死亡，當時被稱為黑死病。最近而該地區的囓齒動物（如土撥鼠）中就發現了這種細菌。</summary></entry><entry><title>AI模型會成為年輕人身體形象的下一個重大威脅嗎？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm17k0e2y5qxo/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:12:47Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T00:21:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm17k0e2y5qxo/trad--f79b4a389009.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm17k0e2y5qxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">AI人工智慧模型在廣告和社群媒體及廣告領域的興起，是否會損害年輕人的身體自信？</summary></entry><entry><title>找工作？面試中那個你不必回答的問題</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqglw400kdx4o/trad#0</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:12:50Z</updated><published>2026-10-07T00:26:11Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqglw400kdx4o/trad--3b75a7303a5f.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqglw400kdx4o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">如果在求職面試中被問到目前工作的薪水多少，你該如何應對呢？</summary></entry><entry><title>中美AI軍事化背景下 BBC獲悉五角大樓正式停用 Anthropic 工具</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8ezkd09057o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T08:35:20Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8ezkd09057o/trad--a805d8040d07.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm8ezkd09057o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">今年2月，五角大樓將 Anthropic 列為「供應鏈風險」，此前該公司拒絕移除其工具中的安全防護機制。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國圖書館為何正迅速下架眾多圖書？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T06:31:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad--3d503a550f93.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzrd73z6k6mo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國公共圖書館已成為一場激烈意識形態衝突的戰場，這場衝突的焦點在於學生應該能夠獲得哪些書籍。</summary></entry><entry><title>駐日美軍涉謀殺女性被捕 重燃沖繩抗議浪潮</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzd6164jv6ro/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T00:11:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzd6164jv6ro/trad--ca06a540027d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwzd6164jv6ro/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">對於沖繩島上的許多當地人來說，再次有駐日美軍涉嫌犯罪被捕，喚起了他們數十年來積累的挫折感。</summary></entry><entry><title>美軍擬槍決胡德堡基地槍擊案兇手 二戰後首例</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr3wvq8l864do/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T07:34:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr3wvq8l864do/trad--7423dd50c1da.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr3wvq8l864do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">納達爾·馬里克·哈桑的處決將是自1961年以來首次軍事處決，也是自第二次世界大戰結束以來首次以行刑隊槍決方式執行死刑。</summary></entry><entry><title>普京不怎麼去的「黑海北戴河」為何要偷偷重建？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq80zr4l8xkzo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-06T00:11:31Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq80zr4l8xkzo/trad--3c6fb8517cf9.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq80zr4l8xkzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">衛星影像顯示，這座行宮在戰時經歷大規模改建；而法庭紀錄與以現金支薪的招聘廣告，則揭露了這項龐大工程隱藏的文件線索。</summary></entry><entry><title>美國華裔房產經紀涉監視賴清德兒子 被FBI拘捕</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn53n4y7ko/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T07:19:16Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn53n4y7ko/trad--5c8501ec2421.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw5yn53n4y7ko/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國聯邦調查局（FBI）在洛杉磯國際機場逮捕華裔房產經紀張婉瑩，她被指控曾長期監視台灣總統賴清德之子賴廷與。</summary></entry><entry><title>蔡康永現身造勢活動遭砲轟 盤點大陸商界「割席台獨」案例</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T12:26:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad--6b03a763eca1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd82m7r1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">蔡康永現身民進黨沈伯洋造勢活動，事情登上微博熱搜；曾與其合作的大陸汽車企業發表聲明「割蓆」。</summary></entry><entry><title>台北同志酒吧遭搜查 警員歧視言論惹爭議</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz98p0x525xo/trad#1</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T12:43:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz98p0x525xo/trad--e99d3d05ab35.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz98p0x525xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有關注同志權益團體號召集結抗議，逾百人出席表達不滿警方不當執法。警方證實有警員言行不當已懲處；台北巿長蔣萬安致歉。</summary></entry><entry><title>機師刀刺同僚企圖劫機 杜拜往以色列航班乘客化解空難</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T06:20:54Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad--749b0d4eb1b4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/ck3rerpdp7x9o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一架從阿聯酋杜拜飛往以色列的「杜拜航空」（Flydubai）客機上，發生企圖空中劫機事件。其中一名機師刺傷另一名機副機後，機上乘客在機人員協助下闖進駕駛艙並合力制伏施襲者。以色列即將舉行大選，當局尚未透露涉案副機師的施襲動機。</summary></entry><entry><title>「工程師治國」：中國為何熱衷於「超級工程」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T03:16:15Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad--389d07ba0142.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c61kd3ze2mnno/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">大型建設工程正在重塑中國——從巨型大壩、龐大的太陽能發電場，到覆蓋全國的高鐵網絡。北京的「工程師思維」能否助其應對氣候變化？</summary></entry><entry><title>中國Z世代為何迷上玄學拜佛？ 什麼是「心靈經濟」？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T03:42:21Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad--9adb52442aad.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw80zedd4gd8o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">面對就業、收入與未來的焦慮，許多人希望藉此尋求運氣、心安以及掌控感。對某些人來說，這意味著去寺廟上香祈福或算命求籤；對另一些人來說，則是購買號稱能帶來好運的手鍊、符咒等各類產品。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國、台灣民眾如何看「習特會」？專家如何解讀峰會成果？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T14:18:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad--18f15465e5e4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmq5x6557lqdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">中國國家主席習近平時隔11年再次訪美進行國是訪問，與美國總統特朗普舉行今年第二次會晤。今次「習特會」有哪些成果？中國及台灣民眾又如何看待？</summary></entry><entry><title>草原上的數據中心：中國AI雄心背後的算力前線</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad#2</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T13:24:03Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad--62ff8006dc2a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crje8gjn3nl5o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">在中國內蒙古遼闊的草原上，數十座數據中心正以驚人速度拔地而起。曾經的農田與草原，正在快速轉變為支撐中國AI雄心的「引擎」，以滿足狂飆的算力需求。</summary></entry><entry><title>「特習會」後兩架美國 F-16V 抵台 「雖遲但到」的時機與信號</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:14:01Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad--32dd398252e7.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c6pwg52xjp8jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">本周五，台灣在2019年向美國訂購的2架F-16V戰機先行抵達台灣台東空軍志航基地，同批次共有66架同型號戰機，是1990 年代以來台灣首次戰機採購。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普排除美中合作開發人工智能</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:39:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad--fb69b70800e6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cm5ye14v6n8xo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">美國總統繼續拒絕為人工智慧設立監管措施的呼籲，認為這將扼殺人工智慧的發展。</summary></entry><entry><title>特朗普習近平峰會：沒有說出口的議題可能更重要</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T03:48:29Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad--249695977d55.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmzxzl450p2no/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">白宮峰會最耐人尋味之處，或許在於中美兩國領導人沒有說哪些事，以及我們至今仍不知道哪些事。</summary></entry><entry><title>為何特朗普在國宴上送習近平一座華麗的白頭海鵰雕像？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-25T04:56:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad--c71e11bddace.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3qjkx1wdyyxo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">從紅杉木長椅到DVD，饋贈禮物一直是外交藝術的重要一環。</summary></entry><entry><title>從年輕縣官到國家主席：習近平41年來的訪美影像</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad#3</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-22T14:36:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad--63b1eb81b86b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c9zrz24j8pdvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">習近平即將到訪美國會晤特朗普（川普），這將是他歷來第11次以中國官方身份訪美。從31歲縣委書記到中國國家主席，BBC中文透過歷年照片，回顧他的訪美行程如何隨身份和中美關係變化。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國開始打擊AI戀愛關係，是過度干預還是先見之明？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-01T08:12:13Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad--ed512c4d390c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmz9z9e4247vo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">北京正在打擊那些能夠模擬人際關係的AI聊天機器人。專家質疑這是否是正確的做法。</summary></entry><entry><title>加拿大為何要為（概率極小的）美國入侵做準備</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-04T11:51:41Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad--2e67e2640a9d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cr89zllz31wdo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">加拿大總理馬克‧卡尼表示，軍方正在製定應對方案，以防美國入侵加拿大這種不太可能發生的情況。</summary></entry><entry><title>軍情五處警告：中國資助英國研究，成果交予北京間諜機關</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T16:46:19Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad--3ce57e9fe961.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cmwyz8y494xvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">當局敦促英國各大學，停止與中國通用技術研究院往來，該研究院與中國國家安全部有聯繫。</summary></entry><entry><title>中國人工智慧工具「教導」研究人員製造生物武器</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T02:20:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad--4c69da1a77f0.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c64grn5g7em2o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">有研究機構發現月之暗面的Kimi模型可以繞過開發者的安全限制，提供製造生化武器的資訊。</summary></entry><entry><title>「我喜歡證明別人錯了」：這些女性自己做裝修和水喉工程</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad#4</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T01:42:08Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad--1053cbb88aa1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq36lg32d362o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">女性DIY專家和女性工匠談及她們如何改變傳統男性主導的領域。</summary></entry><entry><title>「他們叫他爸爸」：震驚韓國的殘障院舍住戶性侵案</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T10:15:06Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad--0a6a1ac930af.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cknv0d8qd7v7o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">BBC採訪了這所照護機構三名遭工作人員性侵院友中的其中一人。</summary></entry><entry><title>印度如何陷入對中國進口商品的危險依賴？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T06:15:56Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad--0d6524b461fb.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c98rzd1ye6n0o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">印度的玩具店意外成為衡量中國與印度經濟關係的一項指標。</summary></entry><entry><title>西班牙與中國愈走愈近，歐盟多方為何不滿？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-02T05:09:30Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad--3063e71a6b74.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cx9808vgjy09o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">全球局勢動盪之際，西班牙與中國意外走近，但這並非唯一不尋常的夥伴關係。</summary></entry><entry><title>「你有五年規劃，我有移民計劃」：香港年輕人為何焦慮？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-23T18:19:34Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad--de8c1aec18c6.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cw804230yrjzo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">9月16日，香港特首李家超發表香港首個五年規劃文件及年度施政報告。但在網絡上，部分年輕人卻開始討論如何離開香港。BBC中文訪問三位香港青年，了解他們的看法。</summary></entry><entry><title>2026台灣地方選舉：「九合一」為何重要？選舉時程是什麼？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad#5</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-16T04:47:26Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad--d50ebbd623d5.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cp931k7xx4do/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">台灣的地方選舉又稱「九合一」選舉，每四年一次，多數落在總統任期中段的年底，故被視為總統的「期中考」。</summary></entry><entry><title>寒背又疼痛？五個保護頸部的運動</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-05T00:15:14Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad--3d466eb5f8f4.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c3lylw2yx1pvo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">現代生活為頸部帶來不少挑戰，但我們可以做很多事情，減低頸部問題出現的風險。</summary></entry><entry><title>為什麼有些人坐電動車更容易暈車？</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-10-03T04:19:55Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad--14e59404515c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cq62yr0ndd5zo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">一名治療暈動症的醫生說：「（坐電動車暈車的個案）我聽過很多、很多、很多次。」</summary></entry><entry><title>貓眼如何啟發機器人的照相機技術發展</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-30T04:54:09Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad--1e0f028ac70a.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/crz9zd51289jo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">據說曾啟發反光道路標記發明數十年後，貓眼的形狀和「發光」現象如今正被工程師仿效，用於設計高科技相機。</summary></entry><entry><title>人工智能末世論：為什麼有人相信AI是敵基督，誘騙人類崇拜撒旦</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:32Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad--ffab2177ccfe.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/c54g7dr9nlkpo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">許多知名基督徒在 TikTok、播客、出版物等各種平台上開始討論人工智能是否會成為世界毀滅的催化劑。</summary></entry><entry><title>在印尼一座熱帶島嶼上，備受珍視的「永恆積雪」即將永遠消失</title><id>https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad#6</id><updated>2026-10-07T06:11:43Z</updated><published>2026-09-29T00:07:17Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../../pages/www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad--98f7f9cf887c.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cwly54drj5l1o/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;at_campaign=rss" /><summary type="html">氣候變化正改變著印尼巴布亞長年被積雪覆蓋的山峰，而這些山峰不但具有科學價值，還有其精神意義。</summary></entry></feed>
